# Force LF regardless of core.autocrlf. scripts/entrypoint.sh runs inside a
# Linux container via `/bin/sh`; a CRLF-mangled shebang line fails with
# "no such file or directory" even though the file looks fine in an editor.
# See AGENTS.md "Recent Lessons Learned" for the prettier/autocrlf trap this
# repository already hit once with generated docs output.
*.sh text eol=lf
